Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 13:43:14 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] feat(castore/fs): cache blobs for DAX

Add DaxCache to materialize blobs as stable, digest-named host files for DAX
mappings. Staged writes expose only complete entries, and a shared cache lets
guests map the same host page-cache pages.

Change-Id: I6d6139b3e0d779b4c735c4859309237417c4dc74
---
